flowchart LR
  Operator[Client operator] --> Installer[Install CLI]
  Installer --> LicenseServer[AXIMA licensing server]
  LicenseServer --> Lease[Short-lived signed lease]
  Lease --> App[Self-hosted AXIMA app]
  App -->|Continuous renewal| LicenseServer
  App --> DB[(Client PostgreSQL)]
  Outage[Network or licensing outage] --> Degraded[Grace period / blocked modules]
  Degraded --> App

